      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Anchor the calendar migration to the release ancestry**\n\nWhen this commit is passed to the guarded backend release command, `resolveReleaseContext` checks every `introducedBy` SHA with `git merge-base --is-ancestor`; `49ff02de...` is a sibling of `152f2c14...` (both have parent `2ce7a1a0...`), not its ancestor. Consequently, `node scripts/production-release.mjs plan --sha 152f2c14071b48512af94edb5332bacf3ce53eb9` aborts with \u201crefusing to omit a registered migration,\u201d so this calendar schema repair cannot be deployed through the required release lane.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
